# Software License Status & Health Research

## Scope

This document contains research related to:

- License status visibility
- License health visibility
- License lifecycle states
- Expiration awareness
- Renewal readiness
- Risk communication
- Alerts and warnings
- Health indicators
- Capacity risk
- Portfolio health visibility
- Action-required states

Research sources include:

- Industry research
- Competitive benchmarking
- Expert patterns

This document does not contain formal findings.
Formal findings will be created as LICENSE-XXX files after validation across multiple sources.

