# Industry Research

# Research Item 201

Source Type:
Industry Research

Source:
NNG

Topic:
Visibility of System Status

Observation:
Users should always understand the current status of a system and what is happening within it.

Translation to License Management:
Customers should immediately understand:

- Active
- Expiring Soon
- Expired
- Pending Activation
- Action Required

Key Takeaway:
License status should be visible and understandable without requiring customers to inspect detailed information.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://www.nngroup.com/articles/ten-usability-heuristics/

