# Research Item 203

Source Type:
Industry Research

Source:
Baymard Institute

Topic:
Status Communication

Observation:
Users perform tasks more efficiently when systems clearly communicate their current state and required actions.

Translation to License Management:
Status should not only communicate state but also recommended next steps.

Examples:

- Expires in 30 Days → Renew Now
- No Available Seats → Purchase More Seats
- Pending Activation → Activate License

Key Takeaway:
Pair license status with recommended actions.

Confidence:
Medium

Sources:
https://baymard.com

