# Research Item 302

Source Type:
Expert Pattern

Source:
Enterprise Lifecycle Management

Topic:
Expiration

Observation:
Expiration dates alone rarely help customers understand business impact.

Examples:

Instead of:

- Expires in 30 Days

Provide:

- Expires in 30 Days
- New assignments will be blocked
- Product access may be interrupted

Key Takeaway:
Communicate consequences in addition to expiration dates.

Confidence:
Medium

